WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.290
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright!

00:00:04.290 --> 00:00:06.620
Green is not a creative color!

00:00:06.620 --> 00:00:10.820
We're not sure who got Dr. Bright into arts
and crafts, or let him have access to any

00:00:10.820 --> 00:00:12.849
dyes, but it stops here.

00:00:12.849 --> 00:00:17.770
He's trying to dye everything green, from
the water in the cooler to SCP-999, all to

00:00:17.770 --> 00:00:20.730
boost creativity around the Foundation.

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:21.730
No more!

00:00:21.730 --> 00:00:23.939
You can get creative another way.

